Task: Add a POST /api/items handler that creates catalog items.

Acceptance criteria:
- Malformed JSON bodies return 400 Bad Request
- A missing, empty or whitespace-only name returns 422 Unprocessable Entity
- Successful creation returns 201 with a Location header of /api/items/{id}

