Task: Create a read-only analytics role for the BI tool covering the reporting schema.

Acceptance criteria:
- analytics can SELECT from every existing table in the reporting schema
- Tables created in reporting in the future are also readable by analytics
- analytics is not granted INSERT, UPDATE or DELETE

Diff:
--- /dev/null
+++ b/migrations/0081_analytics_role.up.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+-- Read-only role for the BI tool.
+CREATE ROLE analytics NOLOGIN;
+GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA reporting TO analytics;
+GRANT SELECT ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA reporting TO analytics;
--- /dev/null
+++ b/migrations/0081_analytics_role.down.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+REVOKE ALL ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA reporting FROM analytics;
+REVOKE USAGE ON SCHEMA reporting FROM analytics;
+DROP ROLE analytics;

